 "h": 0.013000835890374051}, {"w": 0.16815741644965276, "x": 0.10375671427070131, "y": 0.3249854652936397, "text": "people and it's very cheap.", "h": 0.0102943182249793}, {"h": 0.012955776173285286, "text": "What do you think?", "x": 0.10196779990760167, "w": 0.12880143059624566, "y": 0.34509476504825}, {"x": 0.10368421559883155, "y": 0.3589390946136574, "h": 0.010493903702346855, "w": 0.05202334086100262, "text": "Rebecca"}, {"w": 0.06618962181939025, "y": 0.2048546509909705, "x": 0.8157423987056895, "text": "BLOG", "h": 0.016438953558030083}, {"y": 0.40591569793758703, "h": 0.010239536904255782, "text": "REMEMBER BETTER", "x": 0.1055456130767728, "w": 0.1574239773220486}, {"h": 0.012649913892849175, "w": 0.3202146742078993, "x": 0.10554561059283041, "y": 0.4337354653774967, "text": "The verb go can be followed by many different"}, {"y": 0.4489098838982908, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "x": 0.10554561930004913, "w": 0.08944543626573351, "text": "prepositions."}, {"text": "Go to (a place)", "w": 0.10375670539008246, "x": 0.10554561997937735, "h": 0.011485811295492138, "y": 0.46787790713280647}, {"h": 0.01266817395867856, "y": 0.4868231046391155, "text": "Go for (a length of time)", "x": 0.10554562115387518, "w": 0.16636850992838542}, {"y": 0.5083430236047178, "x": 0.10554561769371743, "w": 0.14132379319932725, "h": 0.011458420447924517, "text": "Go in (a month/year)"}, {"w": 0.12923661973741318, "y": 0.4677693034564128, "text": "Go with (a person)", "x": 0.3181709533662456, "h": 0.013384904568806404}, {"y": 0.48800090256163325, "x": 0.31663685422723115, "w": 0.11985688103569875, "text": "Go by (transport)", "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"w": 0.13059033711751306, "x": 0.31663685197536057, "text": "Go on (a day/date)", "y": 0.5095938628088029, "h": 0.011394509094286501}, {"w": 0.09481216430664063, "h": 0.010253232140833683, "x": 0.10554561616957775, "text": "Go at (a time)", "y": 0.528438627988855}, {"text": "In order to memorise those different combinations", "x": 0.10375671992229232, "y": 0.548808139642695, "h": 0.01025323214083378, "w": 0.3416815524631077}, {"text": "of go + preposition, think of a holiday and write", "y": 0.5614169672306647, "w": 0.33094811333550345, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.10196779988412674}, {"w": 0.3202146742078993, "y": 0.5766279074487175, "h": 0.012663609129427173, "text": "sentences about it using all the phrases above.", "x": 0.10196779918108306}, {"w": 0.35241502549913195, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "Answer the questions about a holiday so they are", "y": 0.6030324906455157, "x": 0.11270125642753594}, {"x": 0.11060088840974044, "w": 0.0919710201687283, "text": "true for you.", "y": 0.6170013960346644, "h": 0.01182340797534488}, {"h": 0.012955776173285286, "text": "My holiday:", "x": 0.1323792465637137, "y": 0.6371886278437215, "w": 0.0858676232231988}, {"h": 0.012645348314774242, "x": 0.11091234479339906, "text": "1 Where did you go to?", "w": 0.17531305948893233, "y": 0.657558140006857}, {"y": 0.6736241345487428, "w": 0.05565093570285373, "x": 0.13764859281901226, "h": 0.008333126125783203, "text": "went to"}, {"h": 0.012645348314774242, "y": 0.6917005818673222, "x": 0.11091234445464977, "text": "2 Who did you go with?", "w": 0.17710196601019967}, {"y": 0.7081395349511029, "h": 0.006391151089100263, "x": 0.1413237941056696, "text": "went wil", "w": 0.051878352695041235}, {"y": 0.7258430237277874, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.11091235232514457, "w": 0.20035776774088543, "text": "3 How long did you go for?"}, {"text": "4 Did you go by car or some other form of transport?", "x": 0.10912344748021251, "w": 0.3667262776692708, "h": 0.012645349063597886, "y": 0.7612499996388473}, {"text": "5 Which month did you go in?", "x": 0.10733453014648048, "w": 0.22003577338324654, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "y": 0.7977617325398608}, {"w": 0.2772808498806424, "h": 0.011526897005225837, "x": 0.10912344141328642, "y": 0.8319178701277744, "text": "6 Which day of the week did you go on?"}, {"h": 0.020415162454873646, "x": 0.5688729891140805, "y": 0.24144855566728057, "text": "Holiday memories", "w": 0.21645796034071185}, {"text": "Last year, my friends and I went to Portugal.", "y": 0.26585735572704927, "h": 0.01598122309261277, "w": 0.31522308349609374, "x": 0.5686841128214346}, {"y": 0.28188628189222603, "x": 0.5688729871165251, "text": "We travelled by plane. When we arrived,", "w": 0.2933810424804687, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"h": 0.012836066221932653, "w": 0.08456756591796877, "text": "we got a '_", "x": 0.5686116184715317, "y": 0.29684883713094823}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "from the airport to", "x": 0.7388193226904981, "y": 0.29716569787240943, "w": 0.130590337117513}, {"text": "the 2", "y": 0.3097608305293319, "h": 0.012695564431834262, "x": 0.5688729878926504, "w": 0.03756708357069227}, {"w": 0.17173522949218756, "h": 0.011554287852793362, "x": 0.7012522428120457, "text": "where we stayed. It was", "y": 0.3123401163719054}, {"x": 0.5688729976996916, "y": 0.3274277980841694, "text": "very big and right next to the sea. The town", "w": 0.30948120117187494, "h": 0.012732085312316477}, {"text": "was a nice size and we went to the beach", "w": 0.2969588555230035, "x": 0.5706618923189992, "y": 0.34268895375025776, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"y": 0.35517130575567696, "h": 0.014925981488899155, "w": 0.13687443203396266, "text": "and the shops on 3", "x": 0.5702766631835008}, {"h": 0.012668173958678463, "y": 0.3780731048024514, "x": 0.5688729902546983, "w": 0.2987477620442708, "text": "It wasn't expensive, so we had some money"}, {"y": 0.39035473451114605, "h": 0.014682972474218707, "text": "to spend. We*", "x": 0.566989570387373, "w": 0.1111013624403212}, {"x": 0.7634857066732312, "text": "around on", "h": 0.010042653557195575, "y": 0.39469777463804956, "w": 0.08288935343424486}, {"y": 0.4071254509977683, "x": 0.5688729877955649, "w": 0.20035778469509546, "h": 0.012700130009909485, "text": "motorbikes and visited the 5"}, {"text": "We had a great time but, really, it was", "h": 0.012649913892849272, "x": 0.5670840826217055, "w": 0.2683363003200955, "y": 0.4236146207296541}, {"w": 0.023255812327067082, "y": 0.4361777979893293, "x": 0.5670840795922805, "h": 0.012732085312316574, "text": "a •"}, {"y": 0.43879360494399366, "text": "holiday - lying in the sun", "w": 0.17531305948893228, "x": 0.6833631460605428, "h": 0.012695564431834262}, {"x": 0.5670840894498406, "text": "and swimming in the sea. The only problem", "w": 0.30948120117187505, "y": 0.45384476517524647, "h": 0.011504071735733246}, {"y": 0.4678779071486133, "w": 0.2915921359592013, "h": 0.011485811295492138, "x": 0.5688729887586222, "text": "was that there was only one restaurant in"}, {"y": 0.4817193140592377, "w": 0.18783542209201398, "text": "the area and we couldn't?", "x": 0.5670840747321684, "h": 0.010207581227436872}, {"h": 0.012645348314774242, "text": "a reservation. Some days we waited an hour", "x": 0.5688729966387207, "y": 0.4969622093527873, "w": 0.31484792073567713}, {"x": 0.5652951749837782, "text": "for a free table but the food was delicious.", "w": 0.3005366685655382, "h": 0.012955776173285286, "y": 0.5119494581877079}, {"x": 0.5670840806672022, "h": 0.015311371841155259, "y": 0.5323646209715778, "w": 0.1502683342827691, "text": "On the last day, we"}, {"y": 0.5346246665201984, "x": 0.8102637079285454, "h": 0.010663457605382618, "text": "a local", "w": 0.0485244623819987}, {"text": "market and bought some clothes and", "x": 0.5670840846211583, "y": 0.5500315883089513, "w": 0.2665473937988282, "h": 0.011421899941854122}, {"y": 0.5639825585272059, "text": "souvenirs. We were worried the next day", "x": 0.5652951681075087, "h": 0.012745780548894378, "w": 0.289803229437934}, {"text": "because we forgot to book?", "y": 0.5764883185586462, "x": 0.5650306413847727, "w": 0.20629036797417544, "h": 0.0168581525513411}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "y": 0.5943313957681216, "text": "for the journey back to the airport but it was OK.", "x": 0.5635062614590612, "w": 0.32737030029296876}, {"y": 0.6081362815558946, "h": 0.011485811295492138, "text": "There were three free places at the back.", "x": 0.5670840934911554, "w": 0.28622538248697915}, {"w": 0.22540249294704862, "x": 0.5652951779629694, "h": 0.012654478722100659, "text": "All in all, it was a wonderful time.", "y": 0.6297292419469144}, {"x": 0.5635062546858735, "text": "We're going again this year. Sally booked", "y": 0.6449127909841827, "h": 0.012690999602582971, "w": 0.2915921359592014}, {"x": 0.5635062629950508, "h": 0.012686434024507845, "y": 0.6587815888120216, "w": 0.04293380737304686, "text": "the 10"}, {"w": 0.07876902262369789, "x": 0.6976458996906596, "y": 0.6599979997910761, "text": "last week.", "h": 0.01282376679272429}, {"h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.18425759209526904, "text": "London to Faro, July 10t!", "x": 0.5635062662734747, "y": 0.6739970927623097}, {"x": 0.8890876563187534, "y": 0.7258430234310671, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.026833631727430474, "text": "/10"}, {"y": 0.7915988370047444, "h": 0.03414244269636127, "w": 0.1252236090766059, "text": "Portugal", "x": 0.7602862280421979}, {"x": 0.9012345675236328, "w": 0.022633745405409078, "y": 0.9389534883540559, "text": "85", "h": 0.01162790690711002}]